SETUP COMMANDS
----------------------------------------------------------------

# Install
winget install Cloudflare.cloudflared

# Verify
cloudflared --version

# Log in (opens browser, pick tomrushtonportal.co.uk)
cloudflared tunnel login

# Create the tunnel
cloudflared tunnel create node-server
# → UUID: cbd602d5-5946-4712-81e8-1c9b77f23f68

# Route DNS — use SUBDOMAIN ONLY, not the full domain
cloudflared tunnel route dns node-server jcb
# → Creates jcb.tomrushtonportal.co.uk → tunnel


